### 背景与目标描述.

#### 背景
Mindspore lite缺少kernel追踪的相关可视化功能，对于每个算子在整体的时间中哪一段时间在跑不能够看出来，时间占比不能够直观看出来；缺少跑整个模型时的时间线，即缺少对整个模型的整体追踪；同时在使用多设备在运行模型时也不能够看出来哪个算子跑在哪个设备上。

#### 目标
Mindspore lite支持kernel的执行开始时间、结束时间、耗时、使用的设备等信息生成可以用于可视化的json文件。

### 建议的方案.

#### 详细设计方案：
1. 在`include/api/types.h`文件的MSCallBackParam结构体添加arch，用于区分后端；
2. 在`mindspore-lite/src/litert/cxx_api/model/model_impl.cc`文件添加`GetConfig`接口，用来获得配置文件的信息；
3. 在`mindspore-lite/src/litert/cxx_api/model/model.cc`文件的Predict函数调用GetConfig接口，获得`enableTracing`条件判断，当enableTracing=on时，进行kernel的tracing功能，新建PredictWithTracing函数，用于收集kernel信息，最后将kernel信息写入json文件；
实现代码大致如下:
```
Status Model::PredictWithTracing(const std::vector<mindspore::MSTensor> &inputs,
                                 std::vector<mindspore::MSTensor> *outputs) {
  MSKernelCallBack ms_before_call_back_ = nullptr;
  MSKernelCallBack ms_after_call_back_ = nullptr;
  std::vector<json> trace_events;
  std::unordered_map<std::string, uint64_t> op_start_times;
  uint64_t first_op_start_time = 0;
  bool first_op_set = false;

  ms_before_call_back_ = [&, this](const std::vector<mindspore::MSTensor> &before_inputs,
                                   const std::vector<mindspore::MSTensor> &before_outputs,
                                   const MSCallBackParam &call_param) {
    if (before_inputs.empty()) {
      MS_LOG(INFO) << "The num of beforeInputs is empty";
    }
    if (before_outputs.empty()) {
      MS_LOG(INFO) << "The num of beforeOutputs is empty";
    }
    auto op_start_time = GetTimeUs();
    std::string op_name = call_param.node_name;
    if (!first_op_set) {
      first_op_start_time = op_start_time;
      first_op_set = true;
    }
    op_start_times[op_name] = op_start_time;
    return true;
  };
  ms_after_call_back_ = [&, this](const std::vector<mindspore::MSTensor> &before_inputs,
                                  const std::vector<mindspore::MSTensor> &before_outputs,
                                  const MSCallBackParam &call_param) {
    if (before_inputs.empty()) {
      MS_LOG(INFO) << "The num of beforeInputs is empty";
    }
    if (before_outputs.empty()) {
      MS_LOG(INFO) << "The num of beforeOutputs is empty";
    }

    auto op_end_time = GetTimeUs();
    std::string op_name = call_param.node_name;
    std::string op_type = call_param.node_type;
    auto it = op_start_times.find(op_name);
    if (it != op_start_times.end()) {
      uint64_t op_start_time = it->second;
      uint64_t relative_start_time = op_start_time - first_op_start_time;
      uint64_t relative_end_time = op_end_time - first_op_start_time;
      json event;
      event["name"] = op_name;
      event["ph"] = "X";
      event["ts"] = relative_start_time / 1000.0;
      event["dur"] = (relative_end_time - relative_start_time) / 1000.0;
      event["tid"] = 1;
      event["cat"] = op_type;

      event["args"] = {
        {"op_type", op_type}, {"start_time_us", relative_start_time}, {"end_time_us", relative_end_time}};

      trace_events.push_back(event);
      op_start_times.erase(it);
    }
    return true;
  };
  auto result = impl_->Predict(inputs, outputs, ms_before_call_back_, ms_after_call_back_);
  json output_json;
  output_json["displayTimeUnit"] = "ms";
  output_json["schemaVersion"] = "1.0.0";
  output_json["span_indx"] = "0";
  output_json["traceEvents"] = trace_events;

  std::ofstream json_file("op_trace.json");
  json_file << output_json.dump(4);
  json_file.close();
  return result;
}
//
Status Model::Predict(const std::vector<MSTensor> &inputs, std::vector<MSTensor> *outputs,
                      const MSKernelCallBack &before, const MSKernelCallBack &after) {
  if (MS_UNLIKELY(impl_ == nullptr)) {
    MS_LOG(ERROR) << "Model implement is null!";
    return kLiteNullptr;
  }
  auto tracing = impl_->GetConfig(lite::kKernelTracingSection, lite::kEnableTracing);
  if (tracing == lite::kEnableValue) {
    return PredictWithTracing(inputs, outputs);
  }
  return impl_->Predict(inputs, outputs, before, after);
}
```
该json文件可以使用谷歌的插件`chrome://tracing/ `或者[在线工具](https://ui.perfetto.dev/)进行可视化展示。
